	<section_number>30-14.01</section_number>
	<catch_line>Certifying copy of act; fee</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Clerk of the House of Delegates shall charge for certifying a copy of an Act of Assembly the sum of five dollars.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 14-115; 1964, c. 386, § 14.1-104; 1989, c. 186; 1998, c. 872.</history>
